# The Real Gift (otherAreas 22): Oswald's replies against The Gift accepted (a GM: 71, Event; The_Gift sorts first). No
# setting needed. Accepted: 71, then 74 (Event: they take turns). Completed: 76 (replaceDefault) loses to 71 every time (a
# Progress 76 would play every time). 73's kind is in `#offer`; the trade's (75 Progress, no competitor) in
# XI.Verify.Quests `oa g2 kinds`.
lists Selbina/Oswald/onTrigger Selbina/onEventFinish/75
char zone=Selbina pos=48.6,-15.3,8 job=WAR lvl=30
quest OtherAreas.UnderTheSea completed
quest OtherAreas.TheSandCharm completed
quest OtherAreas.TheGift accepted
quest OtherAreas.TheRealGift accepted
item ShallShell
login
trigger Oswald                          # 71 (a tie with 74: The Gift's first)
finish
trigger Oswald                          # 74 (4484)
finish
trade Oswald ShallShell x1              # 75
finish                                  # completed
trigger Oswald                          # 76 (replaceDefault) loses: 71
finish
trigger Oswald                          # 71 again
finish
